  "$comment": [
    "Vocabulary for the synthetic-data generator. Committed rather than drawn",
    "from Faker at runtime: determinism then depends only on this file and the",
    "seeded PRNG, not on a third-party library's internal RNG, which changes",
    "between versions and would silently alter the dataset on upgrade.",
    "",
    "Names and places are ordinary Indian retail vocabulary. No entry refers to",
    "a real person, and no data here was downloaded from an external source."
