  "$commentProducts": [
    "Each category contributes products built as '<modifier> <noun>'. priceBand",
    "is the inclusive rupee range for that category's catalogue prices, so",
    "Electronics is genuinely more expensive than Grocery and category revenue",
    "charts show real spread rather than uniform noise."
  ],
